[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_tducl"]
script = ExtResource("5_66e8j")
markedup_text = "Fell the tree before it hurts someone."
outcome = SubResource("Resource_hor8d")
markedup_result_text = "Axes ring out, and the giant is quickly felled.

The danger is gone, but there is a conspicuous gap in the canopy now, a scar of light among the rustling crowns."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_m3yus"]
script = ExtResource("3_3352s")
markedup_text = "The grandfather of the grove, a massive tree that has sheltered countless picnics, has begun to lean.

On closer inspection the caretaker finds that the trunk has rotted, and much of it is hollow. It now stands as an empty shell, waiting for the first strong gale to snap it like a dried reed.

Opinions on how to deal with it are divided: a builder wants to fill it, a gardener wants to prop it, and nervous visitors just want it gone before it falls and hurts someone."
